PMD Sky Sprites
by Shane Hudson, art by the PMDCollab SpriteCollab community
and, optionally, your own Explorers of Sky cartridge

WHAT IT DOES
Dresses the sky: wild flyers and your FLY mount wear PMD-style
animation sheets, eight facing directions each. With Free Fly 1.7.0+,
an eight-direction mount can fly true diagonals, and turns sweep
through the diagonal rows.

YOUR OWN CARTRIDGE (OPTIONAL, FOR FULL COVERAGE)
The mod ships community-redrawn art only, which covers a small
roster. For every one of the first 251 species, supply your own game:
put a cartridge dump of Pokemon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Sky
(US) -- a .nds file -- inside this mod's folder. The official in-air
animations are then read straight off your cart while you play,
matched per species through the game's own tables. Everything stays
in memory: nothing is extracted to disk and nothing official ever
ships with the mod. The IMPORT PMD option in the mod's settings
turns cartridge reading off. Community sheets still win where they
exist.

WHAT IT DOES NOT DO
Ship any official sprite. Sheets credited to Spike Chunsoft (the
official PMD art) are excluded from the pack; official art only ever
comes from a cartridge you supply. Nothing changes on the ground or
in battles.

CREDITS
Every packed sheet is CC BY-NC 4.0 by its SpriteCollab contributors;
the full per-species credit log ships in CREDITS.md.
